rucic Acid Rapeseed oil, and we are always looking for new growers who want to earn more profit per acre and add diversity to their crop rotation.\nLearn More\nHome\nGrain & Oilseeds\nFeed Ingredients\nOils\nInternational\nAnimal Nutrition\nAbout Perdue\nPerdue News\nCareers\nLocations\nContact Us\n410.543.3650\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms of Use\nAccessibility Statement\n© 2026 Perdue Agribusiness. All Rights Reserved.",
